# (Not the LOD.) The scissor's field mode: SET_SCISSOR with the field bit and the odd bit, a 1-cycle rectangle of a
# primitive colour whose low bits the RGB dither (the magic square) rounds: only the odd rows are drawn, and the
# dither's row is the field's own (y / 2). The model drew every row with y's dither before.
rdram zero
cmd 3f10013f 00100000
cmd 2d000000 03100040
cmd 2f000000 00000000
cmd 3c000000 00000000
cmd 3cffffff fffffdf6
cmd 3a000000 7b5d3fff
cmd 36100040 00000000
cmd 29000000 00000000
